flowchart TD
  start{New or resumed generation}:::switch
  start -->|new| pin[Register the generation pin]:::query
  start -->|resume| resume{Resume at}:::switch
  resume -->|scan| scan
  resume -->|marker| marker
  resume -->|catch_up| catchup
  pin --> scan[Snapshot chunks into staging]:::load
  scan --> marker[Wait for the end marker]:::wait
  marker --> catchup[Catch up from the change log]:::load
  catchup --> publish[Publish the generation]:::load
  publish --> outcome{Run result}:::switch
  outcome -->|continue| retrigger[Re-trigger this backfill]:::flight
  outcome -->|published| done(Done):::transform
  outcome -->|failed| done
  outcome -->|stopped| done
  class scan fraction
